^{:go/end 609} (go/method execVELInt "execVELInt is the integer by-element instructions: mul, mla, mls lane by lane (modulo the element), the long ones on the\nlower or (Sf, the 2 forms) upper half of Vn into elements of twice the width, signed or unsigned, Vd accumulated.\n" [^{:tag (* CPU)} c ^{:tag (* Inst)} in]
