^{:go/end 862} (go/method execVFCVT "execVFCVT executes fcvtn, fcvtl and fcvtxn: a narrowing writes the lower half (the 2 form the upper, the lower kept; the\nscalar fcvtxn one lane, the rest cleared), a lengthening reads the lower half (the 2 form the upper). The half forms refuse\nFPCR.AHP (the alternative half precision a64i does not model).\n" [^{:tag (* CPU)} c ^{:tag (* Inst)} in]
